! eDP-1 is 1920x1080 in a 14 inch lid, ~157 real DPI, run at its native
! resolution - no xrandr --scale, so nothing gets resampled.
!
! 112 is chosen to reproduce the text size of the old setup, which was
! Xft.dpi 196 with --scale 1.75: 196 / 1.75 = 112.  An 11pt font lands at
! 17 physical px either way, but renders sharp here.
!
! Note that xrdb runs this through cpp, so avoid stray quote characters.
Xft.dpi: 112
